OL,3,AWhy is Microsoft's outage lasting so
OL,4,Along and will emails be lost?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major Microsoft outage has impacted
OL,7,Fschools, healthcare systems,
OL,8,Fbusinesses, courts and governments
OL,9,Faround the world.
OL,11,FServices including Teams, Outlook and
OL,12,FAI software Copilot, are being restored
OL,13,Falmost 24 hours since issues first
OL,14,Fsurfaced.
OL,16,FMicrosoft said the outage was not a
OL,17,Fcyber-security incident and was caused
OL,18,Fby a technical issue. It has apologised
OL,19,Ffor the disruption.
OL,21,FHere's what we know about the services
OL,22,Faffected and what went wrong.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/17
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
