OL,3,AMicrosoft outage 'stark reminder' of
OL,4,Ahow much we rely on tech
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlora Hamilton, executive director of
OL,7,Fthe Small Business Charter, said the
OL,8,Foutage was a "stark reminder" of how
OL,9,Fmuch firms "rely on digital systems" -
OL,10,Flike Microsoft Outlook - "to keep their
OL,11,Foperations running".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/17
