OL,3,ACourts, spies and MPs: How the
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage has been felt around
OL,5,Athe world
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 74 countries were affected by
OL,8,Fthe Microsoft outage which was detected
OL,9,Fafter midday US Eastern Time (17:00
OL,10,FGMT) on Thursday.
OL,12,FMicrosoft 365 Services, including
OL,13,FTeams, Outlook and artificial
OL,14,Fintelligence software Copilot, all
OL,15,Fexperienced "connectivity problems",
OL,16,Fthe company said.
OL,18,FAs of early Friday afternoon (GMT),
OL,19,FMicrosoft was reporting improvements,
OL,20,Fwith email queues "significantly
OL,21,Freduced and approaching normal levels".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/17
