OL,4,AMicrosoft outage has been felt around
OL,5,Athe world
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrom city governments in the US to
OL,8,FAustralian spy agencies, the disruption
OL,9,Fwas widespread. Here is what happened
OL,10,Faround the world.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/17
